attempts.raw:
@start **The window opens on a single spine column.** Column 0, `yfaP`, is carried by 100% of chromosomes, persistent, in a region of plasticity in 87% of calls {S1, P}. The model names 96% of them, at 0.09 bits {S1}.

@variable **A variable stretch follows at columns 1 to 6**, `atoB` to `atoS`, carried by 77 to 82%, [[acetate CoA-transferase]] {S2.c1-6, Q}. The long spine of columns 7 to 33, `rcsC` to `narP`, is carried by 92 to 94%, [[nitrate reductase and cytochrome c biogenesis]] {S3, Q}. Column 34, `yejO`, is a fork, carried by 72%, with a second family at 15% {S4.c34}.

@model **The model names more genes on the spine columns than on the fork and variable ones**, 97 against 93%, and hesitates less there, 0.22 against 0.27 bits {M}. Its most hesitant column, 34, `yejO`, is a fork column, at 0.94 bits {H}.

@end **The window ends in fork and variable columns.** Columns 61 to 79, `yeiL` to `yeiS`, are carried by 5 to 89%, fewest named at column 64, 59% {S12}. The last column is `yeiS`, in 78% of chromosomes {E}.

@whole **Across the window it names 95% of genes**, 0.24 bits on average, perplexity 1.3 families {G}. Inside a region of plasticity it hesitates more than outside, 0.85 against 0.17 bits, and names fewer genes, 80% against 97% {C}.

